{"4727690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "S.I.F: The Missing Rescue", "steam_appid": 4727690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4787670], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are new interns on the SIF, national park management team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track down the missing and bring them home safely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Base Camp</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before heading out, check your gear and place equipment orders within your budget — then plan your strategy with the team!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check your remaining budget and information on the missing through the TV set up in the base camp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Inside the National Park</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track the traces scattered through the forest to find the missing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the information from each trace to pick up hints about the missing person's location deep in the maze-like woods!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After dark, the national park is home to things that are neither human nor animal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way to survive them is to stay out of their way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fired</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let too many missing go unrescued, and the whole team gets fired.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything resets. A new mission begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are new interns on the SIF, national park management team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track down the missing and bring them home safely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Base Camp</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before heading out, check your gear and place equipment orders within your budget — then plan your strategy with the team!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check your remaining budget and information on the missing through the TV set up in the base camp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Inside the National Park</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track the traces scattered through the forest to find the missing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the information from each trace to pick up hints about the missing person's location deep in the maze-like woods!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After dark, the national park is home to things that are neither human nor animal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way to survive them is to stay out of their way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fired</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let too many missing go unrescued, and the whole team gets fired.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything resets. A new mission begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "S.I.F: The Missing Rescue is a 1-4 player co-op horror game set deep within a U.S. National Park. Someone is missing. Your team is going in. Navigate a labyrinth of trees while something watches your every move. But the missing person is still out there. Step into the danger. Because that's the job.", "supported_languages": "English, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4727690/073e2bfea12ca27cef8d3f17ea221d2d1545ef2d/header.jpg?t=1787835301", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4727690/62f5af1538f97f5420c2f785c8cf4b95cacea89e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787835301", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4727690/62f5af1538f97f5420c2f785c8cf4b95cacea89e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787835301", "